{"id": "EUVD-2026-104582", "enisaUuid": "41b5caa7-2ce4-3b3a-a5a3-1c4d73d6b22d", "description": "Craft CMS from 5.0.0 before 5.11.0 contains an authorization bypass vulnerability that allows site-scoped GraphQL tokens to mutate other sites' content because requireAllowedSite() is not enforced. Attackers holding a site-A token can create entries in site B via supplied siteId and delete entries, categories, tags, and assets shared across sites.", "datePublished": "2026-10-19T19:10:53", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-20T15:09:02", "baseScore": 9.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:H/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/craftcms/cms/security/advisories/GHSA-7rr3-4jcm-x526", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/craft-cms-5.0.0-before-5.11.0-graphql-site-scope-bypass-via-mutations"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-112776", "GHSA-vgpq-xf77-c94c"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.3, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "81f7a10e-42fc-35f9-8de0-15549c973661", "product": {"name": "CMS", "vendor": {"name": "statamic"}}, "product_version": "5.0.0 <5.11.0"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "aa39e44e-cbb3-3fb6-a515-eb5585aed1f9", "vendor": {"name": "craftcms"}}], "isExploited": false}